=== ARTIFACT ===
# p2-windows W7 page:notifications/AuditLog — native WinUI 3 / Fluent parity port of the web page
# web/src/features/notifications/pages/AuditLogPage.tsx (route /notifications/audit, useAuditLogs -> GET /system/audit).
# NOT the admin AuditLog page (that already ships as FeatureViews.Admin.AuditLogPage); this is the distinct
# notifications surface (single GlassPanel: Recent Activity heading + search + active-filter chip + Time/Action/
# Resource/Details DataTable, with loading / empty / error / no-matches states).
#
# Output (real in-repo paths; the generated prompt's apps/windows/TeslaSync/Features/Notifications path does not
# exist in-repo — the Windows app is apps/windows/TeslaSync.App with code-based feature views under feature-views/):
#   apps/windows/TeslaSync.App/feature-views/NotificationsAuditLogPage/NotificationsAuditLogPage.Model.cs
#   apps/windows/TeslaSync.App/feature-views/NotificationsAuditLogPage/NotificationsAuditLogPage.Source.cs
#   apps/windows/TeslaSync.App/feature-views/NotificationsAuditLogPage/NotificationsAuditLogPage.ViewModel.cs
#   apps/windows/TeslaSync.App/feature-views/NotificationsAuditLogPage/NotificationsAuditLogPage.cs
#   apps/windows/TeslaSync.App/Shell/ShellWindow.xaml.cs                 (NavigationView registration: "NotificationsAudit")
#   apps/windows/TeslaSync.App.Tests/FeatureViews/NotificationsAuditLogPageTests.cs (+ 3 Compile links in the test csproj)
#
# Architecture: MVVM via INotifyPropertyChanged state holder (NotificationsAuditLogPageViewModel) over the generated
# C# client feed (AuditLogsClientFeed : IAuditLogsFeed -> IApiClient.SendAsync, operation get_api_v1_system_audit).
# The view is a thin renderer over NotificationsAuditLogProjection.Project (all i18n + formatting + branch flags).
# PageContainer chrome (localized title + subtitle) hosts the TsGlassPanel; SI not applicable (no unit fields on
# this surface). Strings resolve through ILocalizer with the web key + English default (ShellLocalizer bridges the
# Strings/*.resw catalog; the headless gate uses PassthroughLocalizer), matching the sibling admin AuditLogPage and
# every other W7 page — the auto-generated resw is not hand-edited.

